<p>Elon Musk did not appear in Paris on Monday for a voluntary interview requested by French prosecutors, who are investigating his social media platform X and its AI chatbot Grok. French authorities said his absence would not stop the inquiry. Coverage also cast the episode as part of a broader clash between Musk and European authorities over regulation, harmful content, and platform practices. The French probe grew out of complaints and investigations opened in 2025 over allegations that X interfered in French political debate and that X and Grok spread AI-generated child sexual abuse imagery, explicit deepfakes, and Holocaust denial content. Musk has dismissed the case as politically motivated and previously criticized the French authorities involved, while prosecutors have said they will keep gathering evidence without his cooperation.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/tgzL10A3OBgFd4UscCvWLPcP1Rft9ePEmll45jimsIpJ70N35pdvEyz2nNF7iwwuhzkMCY5c8bbTcvCe97Nb31HUXwcQ9zfEIR32H8fL_6wgDCZnaOY_zLtZK1lmTZG5_ezrZXXGYZxias2vZsNZ1Yom8a7PCqgV5x_Y97EZWLRFpascqN56vbrlYOA2Z3m5i0f5fvJfh8iXLA' alt='Elon Musk speaking in Switzerland in January. He has previously denounced the French investigation.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Voluntary status: The Paris meeting was described as a voluntary interview, not a compulsory court appearance, so prosecutors could note the no-show and keep the case moving through other investigative steps.</li><li>Broader Europe rift: The New York Times described Musk&#x27;s absence as part of a wider dispute between US tech groups and European authorities over content moderation and platform regulation.</li><li>Platform scrutiny: Deutsche Welle said investigators are examining whether Grok-generated material helped spread child sexual abuse material, explicit deepfakes, and Holocaust denial on the platform.</li></ul><blockquote>The presence or absence is not an obstacle to continuing the investigations. - Paris prosecutors</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>French prosecutors: Prosecutors said they had taken note of the absence of the people summoned and that the investigation would continue whether or not those invited appeared. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/crk151nn7j3o'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Elon Musk: Musk has portrayed the French investigation as a political attack and previously insulted the authorities involved in a French-language post on X. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3350781/elon-musk-summoned-france-show-over-deepfakes-x-grok-probe'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>European regulators: As the New York Times described it, the broader European view is that major online platforms can face direct scrutiny when questions arise about harmful content and democratic integrity. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/20/world/europe/elon-musk-ignores-french-summons.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/police-and-justice/article/2026/04/20/elon-musk-snubs-paris-prosecutors-summons-over-x-and-grok_6752625_105.html'>Elon Musk snubs Paris prosecutors&#x27; summons over X and Grok</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3350781/elon-musk-summoned-france-show-over-deepfakes-x-grok-probe'>Elon Musk summoned in France to show up over deepfakes on X, Grok probe</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/musk-summoned-by-french-prosecutor-in-x-probe-unclear-if-he-will-comply-11382860#publisher=newsstand'>Musk Summoned By French Prosecutor In X Probe, Unclear If He Will Comply</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/apr/20/french-prosecutors-summon-elon-musk-over-alleged-child-abuse-images-on-x'>Elon Musk snubs Paris legal summons over alleged child abuse images on X</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/crk151nn7j3o'>Elon Musk snubs interview summons by French prosecutors amid X probe</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1sqwuiz/elon_musk_does_not_appear_at_hearing_in_french/'>Elon Musk does not appear at hearing in French prosecutors’ X probe</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638778-musk-france-feud-grok/'>Musk vs France: How X became a target for Paris</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/20/world/europe/elon-musk-ignores-french-summons.html'>Elon Musk Ignores French Prosecutors, Widening Tech Rift With Europe</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/elon-musk-skips-probe-as-france-investigates-x/a-76864163'>Elon Musk skips probe as France investigates X</a> - dw.com</li></ul>